    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "The Petitioner has approached this Court challenging the Order dated 29.04.2024 passed by the Ld. ADJ-06, (West), Tis Hazari Court, Delhi granting bail to Respondent No.2 herein in FIR No.28/2022 dated 05.01.2022, registered at Police Station Mundka for an offence punishable under Section 363 IPC.\n2.",
