      "summary_sent_score": 0.13215135037899017
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Material on record discloses that on 05.01.2022, a missing complaint was made by the father of the victim stating that his eldest daughter aged about 19 years went out from home on 31.12.2021 and since then she is missing.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 690,
      "end": 912,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "05.01.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 727,
          "end": 737
        },
        {
          "text": "31.12.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 871,
          "end": 881
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21862536668777466
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "FIR was got registered on 05.01.2022 by the father of the victim.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 913,
      "end": 978,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "05.01.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 939,
          "end": 949
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22842185199260712
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "He states that his daughter went out from home on 31.12.2021.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 979,
      "end": 1040,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "31.12.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1029,
          "end": 1039
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16202813386917114
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "It is stated that on 05.01.2022, i.e., on the date of the complaint, the age of the victim was given as 19 years but she was actually about 17.5 years of age at that time.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1041,
      "end": 1212,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "05.01.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1062,
          "end": 1072
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13837629556655884
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The complaint records that the victim went out of the residence at",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1213,
      "end": 1279,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21443188190460205
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "This is a digitally signed order.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1280,
      "end": 1313,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10146211832761765
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The authenticity of the order can be re-verified from Delhi High Court Order Portal by scanning the QR code shown above.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1314,
      "end": 1435,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Delhi High Court",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 1369,
          "end": 1385
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06787464022636414
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "The Order is downloaded from the DHC Server on 27/09/2024 at 21:41:46 02:00 PM for school related activities at a friend's house.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1436,
      "end": 1565,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "DHC Server",
          "label": "ORG",
